OL,4,CShooting victim was targeted as she    
OL,5,Clay in bed, say police                 
OL,6,GA woman who was critically injured in  
OL,7,Ga targeted attack was shot as she lay  
OL,8,Gin bed, according to police.           
OL,10,FThe 27-year-old is in a critical but   
OL,11,Fstable condition in hospital following 
OL,12,Fthe incident in the Lambhill area of   
OL,13,FGlasgow at about 23:45 on Monday.      
OL,15,FOfficers described the incident as an  
OL,16,F"abhorrent" and "despicable" and said  
OL,17,Fthey were doing all they could to      
OL,18,Ftrack down the person responsible.     
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
