OL,4,CBrother of Kriss Donald killers among  
OL,5,Cgang jailed for #600,000 fraud plot    
OL,6,GThe brother of two of the race-hate    
OL,7,Gkillers of teenager Kriss Donald has   
OL,8,Gbeen jailed for 10-and-a-half years    
OL,9,Gfor his role in a #600,000 fraud plot. 
OL,11,FAhsan Shahid, 41, was part of a gang   
OL,12,Fwho duped 48 elderly people aged       
OL,13,Fbetween 64 and 95 by posing as police  
OL,14,For bank investigators.                 
OL,16,FHis brothers Imran and Zeeshan Shahid  
OL,17,Fwere jailed in 2006 for killing 15-    
OL,18,Fyear-old schoolboy Kriss Donald in     
OL,19,FGlasgow two years earlier by stabbing  
OL,20,Fhim and setting him on fire because he 
OL,21,Fwas white.                             
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
