OL,4,CMan charged over hit and run which     
OL,5,Cleft pedestrian critically injured     
OL,6,GA man has been charged in connection   
OL,7,Gwith a hit and run in Dundee which     
OL,8,Gleft a pedestrian in a critical        
OL,9,Gcondition.                             
OL,11,FThe 54-year-old remains seriously      
OL,12,Finjured in hospital after being struck 
OL,13,Fby a dark-coloured hatchback on Arran  
OL,14,FDrive, at about 19:50 on 5 November.   
OL,16,FPolice launched an appeal for          
OL,17,Finformation after the vehicle failed   
OL,18,Fto stop at the scene.                  
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
